---
Implement scroll wheel velocity adjustment on drum grid steps.

Hovering over an active step and scrolling the mouse wheel adjusts
that step's velocity up or down.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Scroll up increases velocity (clamped to 127)
- [ ] Scroll down decreases velocity (clamped to 1 or 0)
- [ ] Velocity change reflected in cell color immediately
- [ ] Only affects active (toggled on) steps
- [ ] Step size: ~8 velocity units per scroll tick

## Test Plan
- [ ] Hover over active step, scroll up, verify velocity increases
- [ ] Scroll to max (127), verify clamped
- [ ] Scroll to min, verify clamped
- [ ] Verify inactive steps are not affected
